    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. The burner tube, valve wheels, filler cap, pump and wooden handle are all separately resolved and read clearly in the top and bottom views. Tarnished brass with green patina is consistent all the way around the reservoir. Wireframe confirms a clean revolved body with no pole artefacts.",
